{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.vertexVolume_local","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.vertexVolume_local","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L68-L68","doc":"**(2) Locality of vertex volumes**: the per-position vertex\nvolume depends only on the normal-form symbol at that\nposition — i.e. on `nfSymbolAt x i`, not on the rest of `x`.\nThis is now a *real* property: any two elements `x`, `y`\nsharing a normal-form symbol at position `i` produce the\nsame per-position contribution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.markovLocality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.markovLocality","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L59-L59","doc":"**(1) Markov locality**: appending a single generator\nmultiplies the trace by `markovParameter`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.vertexVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.vertexVolume","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L56-L56","doc":"Per-position vertex volume. Defined in terms of the\nnormal-form symbol at that position, encoding the locality\nrequirement at the *type* level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.nfSymbolAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.nfSymbolAt","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The normal-form symbol at position `i` of `x` (the $i$-th\ngenerator index of the GS normal-form word, or a sentinel\nwhen `i ≥ nfLength x`). Carrying this as a class field\nforces an instance to supply the actual normal-form data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.nfLength","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.nfLength","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L47-L47","doc":"A function returning the GS normal-form word length. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.generator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.generator","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L45-L45","doc":"A distinguished family of \"single generators\" (analogue of\n`σ_i`) producing the Markov-locality identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.markovParameter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.markovParameter","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L42-L42","doc":"The Markov parameter `z`. Canonically convention D,\n`z = q³/(q² + 1)`; not pinned by this class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.trM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.trM","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The Markov trace on `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation.mk","kind":"ctor","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation","kind":"class","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean#L30-L72","doc":"**Locality–non-locality reconciliation class.**\n\nGiven a Hecke-algebra-like carrier `A` with trace `trM`, normal-form\nfunction `nf`, and per-vertex local volume `vertexVolume`, packages\nthe three identities of the reconciliation. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:trace-locality-meets-gs-non-locality","label":"prop:trace-locality-meets-gs-non-locality","md":"quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/trace-locality-meets-gs-nonlocality.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}